  "text_md": "![](<ee9d425ceb208aed7d1e2220145e315487706d09_page_1_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\nUNIVERSITY OF AMSTERDAM\n\n# UvA-DARE (Digital Academic Repository)\n\n# Lattice models with N=2 supersymmetry\n\nFendley, P.; Schoutens, K.; de Boer, J.\n\nPublication date 2003\n\n# Published in\n\nPhysical Review Letters\n\n# Link to publication\n\n# Citation for published version (APA):\n\nJ. (2003). Lattice models with N=2 supersymmetry. Physical Review Letters , 90 , 120402.\n\n# General rights\n\nto download or to forward/distribute the text or part of it without the consent of the author(s) and/or copyright holder(s), other than for strictly personal, individual use, unless the work is under an open content license (like Creative Commons).\n\n# DisclaimerIComplaints regulations\n\nof certain material infringes any of your rights or (privacy) interests, please let the Library know, stating your reasons. In case of a legitimate complaint, the Library will make the material inaccessible and/or remove it from the website. Please Ask the Library: https://uba.uva.nl/en/contact, or a letter to: Library of the University of Amsterdam, Secretariat, Singel 425, 1012 WP Amsterdam, The Netherlands. You will be contacted as soon as possible.\n\n",
